Method is an option for various algorithm-intensive functions that specifies \
what internal methods they should use.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"d2ee68ed-c7c3-9b42-b4c1-80fe96b63e94"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "f5c90d66-c16e-d848-9e84-e201285d3cb8"], 
    ButtonBox["OutputSense",
     BaseStyle->"Link",
     ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/OutputSense"], 
    ButtonBox["False",
     BaseStyle->"Link"], Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData[
      ButtonBox["OutputSense",
       BaseStyle->"Link",
       ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/OutputSense"]], "InlineFormula",
      ExpressionUUID->"d831386e-7ec7-6d46-aaeb-6ac9d32c9927"],
     " is an option for ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "CoilWeightedRecon"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "8a4067e0-f09e-a346-854c-9d9f5a96e5d0"],
     ". If set true the function will also output the used Sense map."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"565dd63d-bf1f-f742-bf74-b0c99d250877"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "891233e5-cbaf-a244-86c7-45c2c797524a"], 
    ButtonBox["RescaleRecon",
     BaseStyle->"Link",
     ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/RescaleRecon"], 
    ButtonBox["True",
     BaseStyle->"Link"], Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData[
      ButtonBox["RescaleRecon",
       BaseStyle->"Link",
       ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/RescaleRecon"]], "InlineFormula",
      ExpressionUUID->"ce326756-1a13-f74f-896f-4062726e5003"],
     " is an option for ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "CoilWeightedRecon"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "a3d09e87-c8b5-6147-819e-8b1f20a3a0b7"],
     ". If set true the data will be scaled to the range 0-1000."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"710c381a-6b57-084e-b097-f6491409fe01"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
